---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="CatichkaBeta privacy policy.">
  <div class="wrap page">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="note">Placeholder: review this before launch, and extend it for each app or game, since app stores ask for a privacy policy covering what each one collects.</p>
    <p>This website does not use accounts or cookies, and does not collect personal information from visitors.</p>
    <h2>Visit counts</h2>
    <p>We count visits to this website and to our apps and games, so we know what people enjoy. Each visit sends us the page or game, whether you clicked through to one of our apps or games, and a random ID made on your device so we can tell how many different devices visit each day. We don't record your name, email, IP address or anything you type, and we don't use cookies or share the counts with anyone.</p>
    <p>The random ID stays in your browser's storage. Clearing your browser data removes it. If your browser sends Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track, nothing is counted.</p>
    <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log visitors' IP addresses for security. The font is loaded from Google Fonts. See the GitHub and Google privacy policies for how they handle that data.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</Base>
